# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# E-commerce Monorepo - Created by Gemini
# -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Cart Microservice ###
# Ignore dependencies and environment file for the cart service
/cart_microservices/node_modules
/cart_microservices/.env
/cart_microservices/.env.*

# Ignore logs and build output for the cart service
/cart_microservices/logs/
/cart_microservices/*.log
/cart_microservices/dist
/cart_microservices/build

### 2. General Rules (for all sub-folders) ###
# You can also use wildcards to ignore ALL node_modules
# or .env files in any sub-directory. This is often easier.

# Ignore all node_modules folders anywhere in the project
**/node_modules

# Ignore all .env files anywhere
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Ignore all log folders/files anywhere
**/logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*

# Ignore all build output folders anywhere
**/dist
**/build

### 3. OS & IDE Files ###
# Ignore these files everywhere
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/